1:["$","$Le",null,{"record":{"slug":"camp-2025","section":"events","title":["2025乡村振兴硕博研习营","2025 Rural Revitalization Study Camp"],"date":"2025.11.09 — 11.20","status":["五组共创实践","Five collaborative studies"],"summary":["以乡为馆，以食为媒。围绕生态、产业、社会、文化与空间，学员与导师在屏南共同开展五组短期实践。","The countryside as a museum, food as a medium. Five groups worked across ecology, industry, society, culture and space in Pingnan."],"image":"/assets/editorial/camp.jpg","caption":["研习营课题结构与海报，乡土国际汇报 PDF 第13页。","Study themes and camp poster, presentation p.13."],"topic":true,"chapters":[{"title":["问题从现场出发","Questions from the field"],"text":["研习营接续国际会议，以大食物馆的在地实践为基础，通过访谈、行走、制作与共创，形成五组各有目的的教学工作。","Following the conference, the camp built on the pavilion’s field practice through interviews, walks, making and collaboration. Each group pursued a distinct question."]},{"title":["共同教学","Shared teaching"],"text":["资料列有Tricia Austin、Allan Parsons（研习营文章写作Allen）、姚之洁、蔡文超、黄晓菲等设计导师，以及各课题的专业和在地共创导师。十场讲座涵盖叙事环境、生态农业、遗产叙事与视觉表达等。","Teaching involved Tricia Austin, Allan Parsons (written as Allen in the camp article), Yao Zhijie, Cai Wenchao and Huang Xiaofei, alongside specialist and local mentors. Ten lectures explored narrative environments, ecological agriculture, heritage and visual communication."]},{"title":["时间与资料","Dates and records"],"text":["海报与回顾首段均标明11月9日至20日。回顾中另有“17天”、不同材料中有24／25人两种口径，尚待最终名册与日程核对。回顾文章发布于2026年3月22日，活动仍归于2025年。","The poster and article introduction give 9–20 November. Other passages say 17 days, and sources differ between 24 and 25 participants. These figures await verification. The March 2026 retrospective describes the 2025 camp."]}],"related":["earth-table","field-theatre","compost","wine-play","trail-group","conference-2025"],"sources":["camp","overview","keynote"]}}]
